ed\\n  output: string;\\n  truncated: boolean;\\n  wall_time_seconds: number;\\n}>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"edit\",\"description\":\"Edit a single file using exact text replacement. Every edits[].oldText must match a unique, non-overlapping region of the original file. If two changes affect the same block or nearby lines, merge them into one edit instead of emitting overlapping edits. Do not include large unchanged regions just to connect distant changes.\\n\\n- Use edit for targeted changes. Batch changes to one file in a single call.\\n- Each edits[].oldText must exactly and uniquely match the original file. Keep matches short and non-overlapping; merge nearby changes without including large unchanged regions.\\n\\ncodemode tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { edit(args: {\\n  // One or more targeted replacements. Each edit is matched against the original file, not incrementally. Do not include overlapping or nested edits. If two changes touch the same block or nearby lines, merge them into one edit instead.\\n  edits: Array<{\\n    // Replacement text for this targeted edit.\\n    newText: string;\\n    // Exact text for one targeted replacement. It must be unique in the original file and must not overlap with any other edits[].oldText in the same call.\\n    oldText: string;\\n  }>;\\n  // Path to the file to edit (relative or absolute)\\n  path: string;\\n}): Promise<string>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"write\",\"description\":\"Write content to a file. Creates the file if it doesn't exist, overwrites if it does. Automatically creates parent directories.\\n\\n- Use write only for new files or complete rewrites.\\n\\ncodemode tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { write(args: {\\n  // Content to write to the file\\n  content: string;\\n  // Path to the file to write (relative or absolute)\\n  path: string;\\n}): Promise<string>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"notion_list\",\"description\":\"Search the authorized Skill metadata directory, including